    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cenk The Chopper is a fast paced hack-and-slash game inspired by titles such as Warframe, Devil May Cry, and ULTRAKILL.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chain together slides and dashes to maneuver your way around danger, using various weapons to rip your way through hostiles at blindingly fast speeds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An &quot;unknown&quot; parasite has spread rampantly throughout the world, contorting humans and animals into sick zombified mutants.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as Cenk, one of the last humans left on Earth, try to survive and make your way through the apocalypse in a war for which you are partially responsible. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Swift and Stylish Movement Options<br>     <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3122450/extras/b91af60fe0cfed8672233a50083077c0.poster.avif?t=1751365058\" width=500 height=282 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3122450/extras/b91af60fe0cfed8672233a50083077c0.webm?t=1751365058\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3122450/extras/b91af60fe0cfed8672233a50083077c0.mp4?t=1751365058\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sadistically Creative Combos<br>     <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3122450/extras/6ec235c46a9a251baeac1b84220d0aed.poster.avif?t=1751365058\" width=500 height=282 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3122450/extras/6ec235c46a9a251baeac1b84220d0aed.webm?t=1751365058\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3122450/extras/6ec235c46a9a251baeac1b84220d0aed.mp4?t=1751365058\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique Enemy Interactions<br>     <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3122450/extras/9557fea7b4a77e36887e0edff7e1c316.poster.avif?t=1751365058\" width=500 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3122450/extras/9557fea7b4a77e36887e0edff7e1c316.webm?t=1751365058\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3122450/extras/9557fea7b4a77e36887e0edff7e1c316.mp4?t=1751365058\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cenk The Chopper is a fast paced hack-and-slash game inspired by titles such as Warframe, Devil May Cry, and ULTRAKILL.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chain together slides and dashes to maneuver your way around danger, using various weapons to rip your way through hostiles at blindingly fast speeds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An &quot;unknown&quot; parasite has spread rampantly throughout the world, contorting humans and animals into sick zombified mutants.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as Cenk, one of the last humans left on Earth, try to survive and make your way through the apocalypse in a war for which you are partially responsible. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Swift and Stylish Movement Options<br>     <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3122450/extras/b91af60fe0cfed8672233a50083077c0.poster.avif?t=1751365058\" width=500 height=282 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3122450/extras/b91af60fe0cfed8672233a50083077c0.webm?t=1751365058\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3122450/extras/b91af60fe0cfed8672233a50083077c0.mp4?t=1751365058\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sadistically Creative Combos<br>     <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3122450/extras/6ec235c46a9a251baeac1b84220d0aed.poster.avif?t=1751365058\" width=500 height=282 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3122450/extras/6ec235c46a9a251baeac1b84220d0aed.webm?t=1751365058\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shar